#
# @file    .gitignore
# @brief   Git ignore rules for Reikon Dash project.
#
# Defines files and directories to exclude from version control. Prevents build
# artifacts, IDE configurations, and OS-specific files from cluttering the repository.
# Organized by category for easy maintenance and understanding.
#
# Philosophy:
# - Exclude generated files (builds, caches)
# - Exclude user-specific IDE settings
# - Include project-level configurations
# - Keep repository clean and portable across development environments
#
# @author  Kevin Delaney
# @date    January 10, 2026
# @company Delaney Motorsports, LLC
# @address Sarasota, FL
#

# Build directories
build/
build-*/
*.user
*.user.*

# Qt
*.autosave
*.qmlc
*.jsc

# CMake
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
Makefile

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
